== Walkthrough ==

''Baobob Miller will make you Wolfhide Armor if you bring him pelts and pay him some gold.''

'''You say, 'Hail, Baobob Miller'''

: Baobob Miller says, "Hello there. My name is Baobob Miller. My '''[sister]''' and I are the best tanners in all of Norrath. Wolves are my specialty. A Nice Wolf Skin '''[garment]''' would be the perfect accessory to your stylish ensemble.

'''You say, "Who is your sister?'''

: Baobob Miller says, "My little sister Chanda is the second best tanner around! Seriously though, she is a very skilled artisan and people travel far and wide to acquire one of her fine bear skin cloaks. I am proud of her. She doesn't really like to meet new people, but if you tell her '''[Baobob sent you]''', I am sure she can help you get into some nice bear skin boots.

'''You say, 'What garment?''''

: Baobob Miller says, "I make the finest wolf skin '''[boots]''', '''[cloaks]''', and '''[belts]''' in all of Antonica.

'''You say, 'What boots?''''

: Baobob Miller says, 'If you can bring me a '''[[Medium Quality Wolf Skin|wolf skin of medium quality]]''' and pay me a fee of say.. hmmmm.. for you.. 15 gold pieces, I think I can make you a pair of boots that will make all of Qeynos envy you.'

'''You say, 'What cloaks?'''

: Baobob Miller says, 'Yes! One of my wolf skin cloaks would go very well with your.. eeerr.. style.. Ahem! Let's see.. I think i can get you into one for 21 gold pieces, but, you have to provide the skin, and I make my cloaks with only the '''[[High Quality Wolf Skin|highest quality of wolf skins]]'''.'

'''You say, 'What belts?'''

: Baobob Miller says, 'Belts are far more forgiving than cloaks or boots. A '''[[Low Quality Wolf Skin|lesser quality pelt]]''' and 5 gold pieces would get you a nice wolf-hide belt.'

Buying one of the items also gives you the following faction adjustments:  

<div class="facblock">
* Your faction with [[Karana Residents]] has been adjusted by 5.
* Your faction with [[Guards of Qeynos]] has been adjusted by 5.
* Your faction with [[Priests of Life]] has been adjusted by 5.
* Your faction with [[Knights of Thunder]] has been adjusted by 5.
</div>

